OL,4,CTinned food and long-life milk boost   
OL,5,Cretail sales after 'Be Ready' campaign 
OL,6,Claunch                                 
OL,7,GRetail sales rose in October, driven   
OL,8,Gby people buying long-life food such   
OL,9,Gas tinned goods and UHT milk,          
OL,10,Gaccording to official figures.         
OL,12,FSales volumes were 0.7% higher as      
OL,13,Fpeople responded to the government's   
OL,14,Femergency preparedness "Be Ready"      
OL,15,Fcampaign, the Office for National      
OL,16,FStatistics (ONS) said.                 
OL,18,FThe campaign encouraged people to      
OL,19,Fstock up in case of disruption to      
OL,20,Fessential services by severe weather   
OL,21,For cyberattacks.                       
